'''Ceeli Durango''' was the [[Parent|mother]] of the [[pilot]] [[Nash Durango]] who lived during the [[High Republic Era]] on [[Tenoo]] together with their partner, [[Kryys Durango]]. They both watched their daughter race in and win the [[Kublop Classic]].<ref name="Nash's Race Day" />

